      "TWA\nTRANS\nWORLD\nAIRLINES\n0 0\n• • TW",
      "TWA-TRANS WORLD AIRLINES\nLockheed L-1049G Super G Constellation\nThe first \"Super G\" Constellation delivered to TWA is shown near lower\nManhattan Island in New York City sometime in 1955. This aircraft\nN7102C, was named \"The United States,\" and was manufactured under\nconstruction number 4583.\nPhotograph courtesy of Trans World Airlines\nAPI 053\nPOST CARD\nAnother Air Pictorials International Historical Publication G-4319\n#21569 © Impact\nPrinted in Japan\n1998. A1.018"
